Hi everyone,

I have released nilfs-2.0.14 standalone package, which includes the
bugfix of the memory leak problem slipped into nilfs-2.0.13.

The memory leak arises every time the garbage collection of nilfs
runs.  Users installed the previous version are recommended to upgrade
to this version (Sorry for inconvenience).

The updated package is available at http://www.nilfs.org/en/download.html.

Thanks,
